WEBVTT

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:30.143
how I still fight
for those who voted for me

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:33.351
and whose voice the regime wants to steal;

00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:35.500
how "fearless" I am.

00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:40.684
But there were many moments
when I was frightened,

00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:43.184
and I wanted to step down.

00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:44.476
I was threatened

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.083
and forced to believe
that I'm alone in this fight.

00:03:49.167 --> 00:03:52.226
And yet the more cities I visited,

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.809
the more people showed up for the rallies,

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:57.268
the less fear I had.

00:03:57.292 --> 00:04:00.601
And then in the days
before the election in Minsk,